- **위계**:
  - Display: 56px / 800 / 1.05 / -0.02em
  - H1: 28px / 700 / 1.2 / -0.01em
  - H2: 18px / 700 / 1.27 / 0
  - H3: 14px / 600 / 1.3 / 0
  - Body Large: 14px / 400 / 1.5 / 0
  - Body: 13px / 400 / 1.43 / 0
  - Body Small: 12px / 400 / 1.33 / 0
  - Caption: 11px / 600 / 1.27 / 0.04em

